--- !u!114 &694553419
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 694553414}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: cake
    options:
    - I brought you some nice fish to cheer you up!
    - What's your name?
    - What are you looking for?
    - Ouch, it looks really painful. Here, let me kiss it better!
    - When did you lose your fin?
    - Don't worry Bruce, everyone has bad days. I'm sure you'll find it!
    - At least you still have your really cool spring! idk what it is, there's just
      somefin about it that's really attractive!
    - Will the fin not grow back?
    - How about we look together? Maybe you just need a fresh pair of eyes to find
      it.
    - I think that was my ship. I'm so sorry Bruce.
    - A giant metal ship? are you sure you didn't just hit your head and you didn't
      realise it broke off?
    - That's awful. Do you think it was an alien?
    - Let's split up and search!
    - How about we get go and eat something?
    - I'll stay here as long as it takes to find your fin.
    respones:
    - GET THAT AWAY FROM ME! I'm allergic to seafood. You tryna kill me?
    - Oh.. Already rushing instead of asking if I need help? No manners...
    - It's not something you'll be able to find, i've been looking everywhere...
      Sorry, guess i'm just in a bad mood since I lost it.
    - Don't kiss me you freak! Do you normally go around kissing people?
    - It broke off my head only yesterday, But i've been looking for it ever since...
    - I guess so. I've been looking for ages, I'm starting to lose hope.
    - you think my missing fin is something to joke about? What if I cut off your
      your tentacle and started joking about that?
    - No, a Springshark fin doesn't grow back, obviously.. What are you an alien?
      Have you never met a Springshark?
    - Nghh.. I guess it might be nice to have some company while looking for it...
      Okay fine you can help me. Hey, You're kinder than you look, stranger. I'm
      sorry about before.
    - You... Did this? But... I was starting to like you... Why... WHY DID YOU DISFIGURE
      ME?.... At least you were honest, but this DOESN'T mean
    - You calling me a liar? Look, I know it sounds untrue, but it's what happened.
      Nothing else to it.
    - No... Probably some Glorp without a license who stole a ship and was going
      for a joyride. Still... I'll eat them whole if I ever find them.
    - Oh, you want to split up to search? okay then...
    - I could go for some mountain tops right now.. Lets go, it's this way... OUGH,
      careful there's a rock there... wait... is that... MY FIN!!!
    - I was wrong about you... You're a real treasure... Hey, what's that over there....
      my... MY... MY FIN!!!!!! THANK YOU THANK YOU!! You're a really blessing.. I'm
      so lucky I met you today, I think there's a reason we met today. It's meant
      to me.
    actions:
    - '(You''re at the spot where you were supposed to meet. When suddenly... You
      feel the ground beneath you tremble, as one of the mountains begins to rise
      up..... )

      Ughh.... Not under there either. Ahh I''ve checked every inch
      of this landscape and not a single sight of my fin... Oh. It''s you.'
    - Maybe I should've been a bit less harsh on you.. My name's Bruce.. I'm looking
      for my fin... it broke off my head and I can't find it anywhere.
    - I've been walking these fields for ages looking for my fin... It's hopeless...
      I'll never be whole again...
    - You wanna know how my fin broke off? I was hopping across this mountain  range,
      when all of a sudden this giant metal rocket came out of nowhere and broke
      my fin clean off. If I ever find out who was flying that ship i'll eat them
      whole...
    - I'm starting to lose hope... Do you think we'll ever find it?
